    <string name="setup_perm_location_why">Required to record your routes and show them on the map. Location stays on this device — nothing is sent to a server.</string>
    <string name="setup_perm_location_bg_why">To keep recording your route when you switch apps or the screen turns off, Tracker needs to access your location in the background. The recorded location stays on this device — nothing is sent to a server. On the next system prompt please pick "Allow all the time" to enable auto-tracking; "While using the app" keeps Tracker working when its screen is open only.</string>
    <string name="setup_perm_activity_why">Lets Tracker detect what you\'re doing (walking, cycling, driving, still) so auto-tracking can pause when you\'re not moving and save battery. Activity data stays on this device — nothing is sent to a server.</string>
    <string name="setup_perm_notification_why">Tracker shows a small status notification while it is recording so you can see at a glance that tracking is on and stop it with one tap. No marketing or promotional notifications.</string>
    <string name="setup_perm_wifi_why">Tracker can record Wi-Fi access points your phone sees during a trip to improve location accuracy in places where GPS is weak (indoors, underground). The radio data stays on this device — nothing is sent to a server. Grant only if you want this.</string>
    <string name="setup_perm_cell_why">Tracker can log cell tower IDs along your route so location can be inferred when GPS isn\'t available. The radio data stays on this device — nothing is sent to a server. Grant phone state and precise location only if you want this.</string>
